  "title": "OPAL Fuels Announces First Quarter 2026 Earnings Release Date and Conference Call",
  "summary": "WHITE PLAINS, N.Y. --(BUSINESS WIRE)--Apr. 28, 2026-- OPAL Fuels (Nasdaq: OPAL) today announced that it will release its earnings results for the first quarter ended March 31, 2026, before market open on Monday, May 11, 2026. A conference call will take place on Monday, May 11, 2026 at 11:00 a.m.",
